<BaseLayout
  title="Sparse-to-Dense Reward: Why Your Labeled Data Belongs on the Teacher | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="A reward-density principle for LLM post-training: spend scarce labeled data on RL-training the teacher, then bridge to the student via dense token-level supervision. Outperforms direct GRPO at fixed data budget."
