  The paper tests whether the teacher-quality ordering — raw-teacher transfer &lt; direct GRPO &lt; RL-teacher transfer — generalizes beyond Qwen3. The Llama experiment uses Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct as the deployment student and Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct as the teacher: a 9× scale ratio, cross-architecture.
